<div dir=3D"auto">Hi, Ranger Logan.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">Would it be possible to come back in May to work the welc=
ome center again? Assuming the position is still open (just perusing the jo=
b board). I'll be at Umpqua in April (Franki found a spot for me) so I'll s=
till be in the area.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">The only caveat I would make to this is I'm going to try =
really hard to become a seasonal park ranger (as long as it's on the coast)=
, if they'll have me. I am unclear on when those jobs are posted and filled=
 so I just want to note this in case
 it causes a conflict if I am fortunately hired. Because of the two year pa=
rk service prerequisite, I'm unsure if I would get hired (it is the main re=
ason I'm volunteering).</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">I am open to any positions. I think I'm a very personable=
 person so I like interesting with guests whether at the welcome center or =
as campground host but I'm just as willing to clean yurts and do maintenanc=
e (I've been enjoying contributing
 to the infrastructure here at Tugman).</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">Sam</div>
<div><br>
</div>
